  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Development and Emergency Water, Sanitation and Hygiene response for COVID-19 Affected Populations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall objective is to address the most immediate and long-term WASH needs of COVID-19-affected urban and peri-urban populations and communities, and through this reduce child mortality and morbidity and enhance resilience among the most vulnerable children and communities.</narrative>
  </description>
